%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 75e7bea227aaf2b499307efe1ddc0480, type: 3}
  m_Name: MerchantDialog_Act1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialog
  NPCName: Merchant
  DialogLines:
  - text: "Careful\u2026 the containment lattice is barely holding!"
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: When the data storm struck, the Core's connection to the three districts
      was severed.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Each district manages a different layer of how this town serves its people.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The reactor cannot repair itself until those connections are re-established.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The fracture... it has touched all three corners of the town.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Hearth District, where the town keeps its memories of each resident...
      Its fires have gone cold since the storm.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Undercroft. A place of quiet record-keeping beneath the streets. Now
      dark, and disrupted.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "And the Scarlet Exchange\u2026 the loudest district in the town. Now completely
      silent."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Core still remembers the paths to those places.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: If you interact with the reactor, it will open a gateway to one of the
      districts.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Travel through it. Speak with our people over there, Chief. Your decisions
      will shape what gets restored.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: With each district reconnected, the Core may begin rebuilding what was
      lost.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "But something about the fracture pattern is wrong\u2026 reactors do not
      fail like this."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: It is almost as if the system rejected something.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Go now. Use the Core to reach one of the districts.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Core will respond when you return.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
